  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## A bad dir is not the end\n\n`Player.move` already faults on a bad dir. Here **you** throw `new Error(\"bad dir\")` if the string is not a compass word. `catch` `say`s the fault, then you still finish the walk east to the beacon.\n\nThe program continues after a handled error."
    },
    {
